  "title": "Hearty Moroccan Chickpeas Tagine",
  "description": "A sour and creamy Moroccan dish featuring chickpeas and condensed milk, perfect for a brunch mood. This macrobiotic-friendly recipe is made with brine-wet ingredients and has a unique flavor profile.",
